### Problem Statement
We need to write a function that takes a list of elements as input and returns a boolean indicating whether all elements in the list are identical.

### Solution

```scala
def allIdentical[T](list: List[T]): Boolean = {
  // If the list is empty, consider all elements as identical
  if (list.isEmpty) true
  // Otherwise, check if all elements are equal to the first element
  else list.forall(_ == list.head)
}
```

